cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "WebvlnUper：基于视觉感知的网页自动导航模型优化"
message: 若本仓库对你的研究有帮助，请按下列信息引用。
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Shan
    given-names: Wuling
    affiliation: 对外经济贸易大学 (University of International Business and Economics)
repository-code: "https://github.com/WulingShan503/webvlnuper"
abstract: >-
  复现 WebVLN-Net 基线（Chen et al., AAAI 2024），并在其之上实现基于
  大语言模型的两阶段候选动作筛选机制：阶段一规则过滤，阶段二 LLM 语义
  排序取 Top-k，用以压缩网页导航中高噪声的候选决策空间。
keywords:
  - vision-and-language navigation
  - web navigation
  - large language models
  - candidate action pruning
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-03-01"

references:
  - type: conference-paper
    title: "WebVLN: Vision-and-Language Navigation on Websites"
    authors:
      - family-names: Chen
        given-names: Qi
      - name: et al.
    collection-title: >-
      Proceedings of the AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence
    volume: 38
    issue: 2
    start: 1165
    end: 1173
    year: 2024
